WEBVTT

00:01:27.250 --> 00:01:32.588
and I'm hoping that those three steps
will be useful to any of you

00:01:32.588 --> 00:01:33.840
who want to do some good

00:01:33.840 --> 00:01:39.053
in the face of any of the myriad
overwhelming conflicts

00:01:39.053 --> 00:01:42.807
that we're facing today,
including Ukraine.

00:01:44.642 --> 00:01:46.602
So what are my three steps?

00:01:47.854 --> 00:01:50.064
Find an entry point,

00:01:50.106 --> 00:01:52.275
identify a gap,

00:01:52.316 --> 00:01:56.737
and then find something doable
with which to fill that gap.

00:01:56.779 --> 00:01:58.656
It sounds pretty simple, right?

00:01:58.656 --> 00:02:00.616
So let me walk you through it.